WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.059
The Fabric Data Agent is designed

00:00:02.059 --> 00:00:02.900
for the end -user.

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:04.860
It provides the conversational analytics

00:00:04.860 --> 00:00:06.740
experience where a regional manager

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:08.320
might sit down and ask everyday

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:09.959
business questions about the data,

00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:11.920
utilizing the logic defined by the

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:14.340
ontology. And third, the Operations

00:00:14.340 --> 00:00:16.900
Agent. The Operations Agent serves

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:18.160
a completely different paradigm.

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:20.259
Its job is not to answer

00:00:20.259 --> 00:00:22.300
questions, but to passively monitor

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:24.280
a defined business process and recommend

00:00:24.280 --> 00:00:25.380
proactive responses.
